d and then passed 3 of 3 in isolation: `tests/interfaces/store/test_bridge_sync_holds_ref_lock.py::test_bridge_sync_honours_an_active_pause` (`cannot pause bridge: git rev-parse --verify timed out after 5.0s (fail-closed: treat as HELD)`) and `tests/interfaces/facades/test_plan_review_attestation_facades.py::test_cli_passed_but_unsigned_is_exit_11_with_byte_identical_stderr` (`OSError: [Errno 48] ... address already in use` binding 127.0.0.1:55506).\n\n## Expected\nNeither test depends on host load: no fixed 5 s subprocess budget in a test path, and no fixed or reused loopback port.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Each failure is reproduced deterministically (injected slow git; a pre-bound port) and fixed at its class.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"8e6c-3a37-8570-4e82","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Two tests fail under host load: a 5 s git timeout and a fixed loopback port","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ccc335da-1560-4ae2-8c67-967fb2898e90","256dc0ef-1c10-48c9-bfcc-aa252c7b9dc1"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793830875633420002,"uuid":"1756ad2a-06e9-4c7d-9096-0de2ad2bde1c"}